  "bodyHash": "692a1f4ed21fac6c",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fpeek%252fwiki%252foverview\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вики</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fpeek%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Авторы</a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Мод для Fabric, предоставляющий дополнительную информацию о предметах и блоках. Может использоваться только на стороне клиента.</p>\n<h2>Необязательные зависимости</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClothConfig</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Возможности</h2>\n<p><strong>Подсказки в шалкеровых ящиках</strong>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fpeek%252fwiki%252fshulker_box_hints\" rel=\"nofollow\">Подробнее</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/14d83b930ef3b4d775c8c46f28716b5073dc9b2c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Содержимое шалкерового ящика</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a75a8484fa8f4f2404ae45d98eab6b187cfe800f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Количество пчёл в улье</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1aacf36761a0a13cd654535046da4310c6af072d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Расположение маркеров на картах исследователя</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e78770e208cc2ee8f1078475c0eee21c6a7d0d44.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c0e58dcb6dbaaf97204005cfafa547d15b538c69.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Назначение компасов</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3bc62cc82cb881da7e645cd32cdd0e1268af74a8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/831a13c338b18084c28033557b069d209e03e346.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bab3f0fa132e1cc593937a19215c62b79a1469bb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Места смерти для компаса возрождения</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bab3f0fa132e1cc593937a19215c62b79a1469bb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/205502ddd047c19d19e23b8aedeef5dba10bbbb8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Эффекты подозрительных рагу</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2ea1c2ecef4d3b56a2112d7e567c7739877639fb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Настраиваемая всплывающая подсказка связки</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b40eff0859bc263dad5eaf31d918de6f935f70b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Содержимое контейнеров при копировании блока</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a53740e26616ab70c6ad74cafef1b9cf09773e37.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1e639e821ba04e3fd4184604521e08f3097bcd4d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aaba7bfc7d09f6e60d4ff476990268fdc40a4fb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c491603ace9783dc22be5ca33ceb80ac547e9118.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>Полная настройка через&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>&nbsp;и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClothConfig</a></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/710ea860876606bb1993340fb1ea97776e7c1ffd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://localhost:63342/markdownPreview/985996617/assets/cloth_config.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
